      "html": "<div class=\"ds-container\"><strong class=\"ds-container-title\">记录与数据</strong><p class=\"ds-container-copy\">查看当前记录的状态。</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-container{padding:14px;border:1px solid var(--color-line,#dce7df);border-radius:10px;background:var(--color-surface,#fff);color:var(--color-ink,#18382c);font:400 15px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif}.ds-container-title{font-size:16px;font-weight:600}.ds-container-copy{margin:6px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--color-secondary,#587065)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "原生三项导航",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "原生 TabBar 的标签与颜色映射示意，实际导航和图标由微信绘制。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"主导航\"><button class=\"ds-nav-item ds-nav-current\" aria-current=\"page\">今日</button><button class=\"ds-nav-item\">进度</button><button class=\"ds-nav-item\">我的</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;background:var(--color-page,#fff);border-top:1px solid var(--color-line,#dce7df)}.ds-nav-item{flex:1;min-height:44px;border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--color-secondary,#587065);font:400 13px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif}.ds-nav-current{color:var(--color-primary,#246446);font-weight:600}.ds-nav-item:hover,.ds-nav-item:active{background:var(--color-soft,#f7faf7)}.ds-nav-item:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-primary,#246446);outline-offset:-2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "今日时间线待做行",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "timeline-checkin",
      "description": "42px 时间、16px 轨道与固定 104px 动作列；示例为视觉片段，不提交数据。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-row\"><time class=\"ds-time\">12:30</time><div class=\"ds-rail\"><span class=\"ds-dot\"></span></div><div class=\"ds-slot\"><div class=\"ds-task\"><button class=\"ds-task-title\">读一会儿<svg viewBox=\"0 0 8 12\" width=\"6\" height=\"9\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m1 1 5 5-5 5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></button><div class=\"ds-task-meta\">平时 20分钟</div></div><div class=\"ds-actions\"><button class=\"ds-checkin\">打卡</button><button class=\"ds-busy\">忙时 2分钟打卡</button></div></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:42px 16px minmax(0,1fr);min-height:102px;color:var(--color-ink,#18382c);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif}.ds-time{padding-top:17px;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--color-secondary,#587065)}.ds-rail{display:flex;justify-content:center;padding-top:23px}.ds-dot{width:7px;height:7px;border:1.5px solid var(--color-control-border,#7a897d);border-radius:50%;background:var(--color-page,#fff)}.ds-slot{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 104px;gap:10px;min-height:102px;padding:6px 0 7px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-line,#dce7df)}.ds-task{min-width:0}.ds-task-title{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;min-width:44px;min-height:44px;padding:5px 0;border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--color-ink,#18382c);text-align:left;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:650;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-task-title svg{color:var(--color-secondary,#587065);flex-shrink:0}.ds-task-meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--color-secondary,#587065);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-checkin,.ds-busy{width:104px;min-height:44px;border:0}.ds-checkin{padding:8px 3px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--color-primary,#246446);color:var(--color-on-primary,#fff);font-size:14px;font-weight:600}.ds-busy{padding:8px 0;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:var(--color-primary,#246446);font-size:12px}.ds-checkin:hover,.ds-checkin:active{box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 999px rgba(0,0,0,.14)}.ds-busy:hover,.ds-busy:active,.ds-task-title:hover{background:var(--color-soft,#f7faf7)}.ds-checkin:focus-visible,.ds-busy:focus-visible,.ds-task-title:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-primary,#246446);outline-offset:2px}@media(max-width:359px){.ds-row{grid-template-columns:36px 14px minmax(0,1fr)}.ds-slot{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 100px;gap:7px}.ds-checkin,.ds-busy{width:100px}.ds-task-title{font-size:15px}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "清爽日程融合",
    "overview": "用户选定 A 的颜色与优化后的 C 时间线。原生页面以白色内容面、克制的绿色状态、细分隔线和稳定的动作列承载日常记录。密度紧凑，任务名称与打卡动作先被看到，次要设置逐步展开。\n\n这是已实施客户端的设计记录。薄雾绿为默认主题，暖纸白只替换语义颜色，两者共用页面结构、尺寸和交互。顶部导航与今日、进度、我的三项底栏由微信原生组件承载。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "真实安排组成时间线，完成项默认展开，置顶任务独立呈现。",
      "颜色、文字和形状共同表达原目标、忙时、未打卡与无安排。",
      "紧凑字号与间距配合至少 44px 的主要操作热区。",
      "表现层沿用云端确认与结果核对，不以动画或本机假状态宣告保存。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Semantic Theme Rule",
        "body": "页面使用语义颜色变量；同一状态在两个主题中保留相同文字、形状与布局。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Content Rule",
        "body": "时间线和日常列表用内容对齐与分隔线建立层级，不叠加阴影卡片。",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do 使用语义 token 与同一套双主题布局。",
      "Do 保持任务、时间轨道与动作列的对齐，长内容允许增高。",
      "Do 用文字和形状补充状态色，主要操作保留至少 44px 热区。",
      "Do 依据云端确认显示保存结果，给待核对、错误、加载和空状态明确入口。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't 将原目标、忙时目标、只调整今天与明天生效合并为同一个动作。",
      "Don't 为对齐截图裁剪真实任务、历史或已启用入口。",
      "Don't 将隔离模拟器、HTML 原型或自动测试写成真实云、真机、双账户或用户验收。"
    ]
  }
}
